{"id":"001b6ab17e88507e","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-proofterm-permutation.md","title":"结构等价、置换等价与证明前缀","display":"df-proofterm-permutation — 结构等价、置换等价与证明前缀","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-proofterm-permutation","aliases":["56-df-proofterm-permutation"],"display":"df-proofterm-permutation — 结构等价、置换等价与证明前缀","depends_on":["[[56-df-proofterm-substitution]]"],"source_section":"§8.3 Definition 8.3.1; Table 8.2; Proposition 8.3.21","source_printed_pages":"329–330,336–337","source_ocr_blocks":[350,351,357,358],"source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; typed-open-term-coding-local","source_proof_status":"local-structural-derivation-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-proofterm-permutation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-proofterm-permutation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proofterm-permutation — 结构等价、置换等价与证明前缀"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b93c21fedffb4c4c\" href=\"?note=b93c21fedffb4c4c\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-substitution\">56-df-proofterm-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.3 Definition 8.3.1; Table 8.2; Proposition 8.3.21"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"329–330,336–337"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>350</span><span>351</span><span>357</span><span>358</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; typed-open-term-coding-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-structural-derivation-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b93c21fedffb4c4c\" href=\"?note=b93c21fedffb4c4c\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-substitution\">56-df-proofterm-substitution</a>。下列各方程仅在所有组合均类型化时取实例。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\square\">\\(\\square\\)</span> 是异于证明树构造标签的新孔符号。原始一孔证明树上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 的孔填入记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K[\\zeta]\">\\(K[\\zeta]\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\zeta\\in\\mathcal Q_R\">\\(\\zeta\\in\\mathcal Q_R\\)</span>；填孔、闭包算子与生成关系均在下文定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\operatorname{PT}_R^2\">\\(B\\subseteq\\operatorname{PT}_R^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R\">\\(\\phi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R\\)</span>。规则构造及I/O方程分支局部取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R\">\\(\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R\\)</span>；各方程中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi_i:s_i\\to t_i\">\\(\\phi_i:s_i\\to t_i\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_R(\\phi_i)=s_i,T_R(\\phi_i)=t_i\">\\(S_R(\\phi_i)=s_i,T_R(\\phi_i)=t_i\\)</span>，不是额外归约关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_R\\coloneqq\\mu A\\;\\left(\\{\\square\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{f\\in\\mathcal F}\\;\\bigcup_{j=1}^{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}\\{\\mathsf F(f;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{j-1},K,\\phi_{j+1},\\ldots,\\phi_n):n=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ K\\in A,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^n\\}\\right.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K_R\\coloneqq\\mu A\\;\\left(\\{\\square\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{f\\in\\mathcal F}\\;\\bigcup_{j=1}^{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}\\{\\mathsf F(f;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{j-1},K,\\phi_{j+1},\\ldots,\\phi_n):n=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ K\\in A,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^n\\}\\right.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left.\\hspace{1em}\\cup\\bigcup_{\\lambda\\in R}\\;\\bigcup_{j=1}^{k_\\lambda}\\{\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{j-1},K,\\phi_{j+1},\\ldots,\\phi_{k_\\lambda}):K\\in A,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^{k_\\lambda}\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf C(K,\\phi),\\mathsf C(\\phi,K):K\\in A,\\ \\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left.\\hspace{1em}\\cup\\bigcup_{\\lambda\\in R}\\;\\bigcup_{j=1}^{k_\\lambda}\\{\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{j-1},K,\\phi_{j+1},\\ldots,\\phi_{k_\\lambda}):K\\in A,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^{k_\\lambda}\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf C(K,\\phi),\\mathsf C(\\phi,K):K\\in A,\\ \\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(-)[-]:\\mathcal K_R\\times\\mathcal Q_R\\to\\mathcal Q_R,\\qquad \\square[\\zeta]\\coloneqq\\zeta\\quad(\\zeta\\in\\mathcal Q_R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(-)[-]:\\mathcal K_R\\times\\mathcal Q_R\\to\\mathcal Q_R,\\qquad \\square[\\zeta]\\coloneqq\\zeta\\quad(\\zeta\\in\\mathcal Q_R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf F(f;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{j-1},K,\\phi_{j+1},\\ldots,\\phi_n)[\\zeta]\n\\coloneqq\\mathsf F(f;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{j-1},K[\\zeta],\\phi_{j+1},\\ldots,\\phi_n)\n\\quad(f\\in\\mathcal F,\\ n=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ 1\\le j\\le n,\\ K\\in\\mathcal K_R,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^n,\\ \\zeta\\in\\mathcal Q_R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf F(f;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{j-1},K,\\phi_{j+1},\\ldots,\\phi_n)[\\zeta]\n\\coloneqq\\mathsf F(f;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{j-1},K[\\zeta],\\phi_{j+1},\\ldots,\\phi_n)\n\\quad(f\\in\\mathcal F,\\ n=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ 1\\le j\\le n,\\ K\\in\\mathcal K_R,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^n,\\ \\zeta\\in\\mathcal Q_R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{j-1},K,\\phi_{j+1},\\ldots,\\phi_{k_\\lambda})[\\zeta]\n\\coloneqq\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{j-1},K[\\zeta],\\phi_{j+1},\\ldots,\\phi_{k_\\lambda})\n\\quad(\\lambda\\in R,\\ 1\\le j\\le k_\\lambda,\\ K\\in\\mathcal K_R,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^{k_\\lambda},\\ \\zeta\\in\\mathcal Q_R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{j-1},K,\\phi_{j+1},\\ldots,\\phi_{k_\\lambda})[\\zeta]\n\\coloneqq\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{j-1},K[\\zeta],\\phi_{j+1},\\ldots,\\phi_{k_\\lambda})\n\\quad(\\lambda\\in R,\\ 1\\le j\\le k_\\lambda,\\ K\\in\\mathcal K_R,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^{k_\\lambda},\\ \\zeta\\in\\mathcal Q_R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf C(K,\\phi)[\\zeta]\\coloneqq\\mathsf C(K[\\zeta],\\phi),\\qquad\n\\mathsf C(\\phi,K)[\\zeta]\\coloneqq\\mathsf C(\\phi,K[\\zeta])\n\\quad(K\\in\\mathcal K_R,\\ \\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R,\\ \\zeta\\in\\mathcal Q_R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf C(K,\\phi)[\\zeta]\\coloneqq\\mathsf C(K[\\zeta],\\phi),\\qquad\n\\mathsf C(\\phi,K)[\\zeta]\\coloneqq\\mathsf C(\\phi,K[\\zeta])\n\\quad(K\\in\\mathcal K_R,\\ \\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R,\\ \\zeta\\in\\mathcal Q_R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cg}_R(B)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\left\\{E\\subseteq\\operatorname{PT}_R^2:\\Delta_{\\operatorname{PT}_R}\\cup B\\subseteq E,\\ E^{-1}=E,\\ E\\circ E\\subseteq E,\\ \\forall K\\in\\mathcal K_R\\;\\forall(\\phi,\\psi)\\in E\\;\\bigl(\\{K[\\phi],K[\\psi]\\}\\subseteq\\operatorname{PT}_R\\Rightarrow(K[\\phi],K[\\psi])\\in E\\bigr)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Cg}_R(B)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\left\\{E\\subseteq\\operatorname{PT}_R^2:\\Delta_{\\operatorname{PT}_R}\\cup B\\subseteq E,\\ E^{-1}=E,\\ E\\circ E\\subseteq E,\\ \\forall K\\in\\mathcal K_R\\;\\forall(\\phi,\\psi)\\in E\\;\\bigl(\\{K[\\phi],K[\\psi]\\}\\subseteq\\operatorname{PT}_R\\Rightarrow(K[\\phi],K[\\psi])\\in E\\bigr)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B_{\\rm str}\\coloneqq\\{(\\operatorname{Id}_R(S_R\\phi)\\bullet\\phi,\\phi),(\\phi\\bullet\\operatorname{Id}_R(T_R\\phi),\\phi):\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B_{\\rm str}\\coloneqq\\{(\\operatorname{Id}_R(S_R\\phi)\\bullet\\phi,\\phi),(\\phi\\bullet\\operatorname{Id}_R(T_R\\phi),\\phi):\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\hspace{1em}\\cup\\{((\\phi\\bullet\\psi)\\bullet\\chi,\\phi\\bullet(\\psi\\bullet\\chi)):\\phi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R,\\ T_R\\phi=S_R\\psi,\\ T_R\\psi=S_R\\chi\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\hspace{1em}\\cup\\{((\\phi\\bullet\\psi)\\bullet\\chi,\\phi\\bullet(\\psi\\bullet\\chi)):\\phi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R,\\ T_R\\phi=S_R\\psi,\\ T_R\\psi=S_R\\chi\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\hspace{1em}\\cup\\{(\\mathsf F(f;\\boldsymbol\\phi)\\bullet\\mathsf F(f;\\boldsymbol\\psi),\\mathsf F(f;\\phi_1\\bullet\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_n\\bullet\\psi_n)):f\\in\\mathcal F,\\ n=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi,\\boldsymbol\\psi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^n,\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(T_R\\phi_i=S_R\\psi_i)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\hspace{1em}\\cup\\{(\\mathsf F(f;\\boldsymbol\\phi)\\bullet\\mathsf F(f;\\boldsymbol\\psi),\\mathsf F(f;\\phi_1\\bullet\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_n\\bullet\\psi_n)):f\\in\\mathcal F,\\ n=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi,\\boldsymbol\\psi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^n,\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(T_R\\phi_i=S_R\\psi_i)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B_I\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\boldsymbol\\phi),l\\langle\\boldsymbol\\phi\\rangle_\\lambda\\bullet\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\operatorname{Id}_R(T_R\\phi_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{Id}_R(T_R\\phi_{k_\\lambda}))) :\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^{k_\\lambda}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B_I\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\boldsymbol\\phi),l\\langle\\boldsymbol\\phi\\rangle_\\lambda\\bullet\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\operatorname{Id}_R(T_R\\phi_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{Id}_R(T_R\\phi_{k_\\lambda}))) :\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^{k_\\lambda}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B_O\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\boldsymbol\\phi),\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\operatorname{Id}_R(S_R\\phi_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{Id}_R(S_R\\phi_{k_\\lambda}))\\bullet r\\langle\\boldsymbol\\phi\\rangle_\\lambda):\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^{k_\\lambda}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B_O\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\boldsymbol\\phi),\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\operatorname{Id}_R(S_R\\phi_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{Id}_R(S_R\\phi_{k_\\lambda}))\\bullet r\\langle\\boldsymbol\\phi\\rangle_\\lambda):\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^{k_\\lambda}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\simeq_R\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cg}_R(B_{\\rm str}),\\qquad\\approx_R\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cg}_R(B_{\\rm str}\\cup B_I\\cup B_O).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\simeq_R\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cg}_R(B_{\\rm str}),\\qquad\\approx_R\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cg}_R(B_{\\rm str}\\cup B_I\\cup B_O).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Id}_R(S_R\\phi)\\bullet\\phi\\simeq_R\\phi,\\qquad\\phi\\bullet\\operatorname{Id}_R(T_R\\phi)\\simeq_R\\phi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Id}_R(S_R\\phi)\\bullet\\phi\\simeq_R\\phi,\\qquad\\phi\\bullet\\operatorname{Id}_R(T_R\\phi)\\simeq_R\\phi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\phi\\bullet\\psi)\\bullet\\chi\\simeq_R\\phi\\bullet(\\psi\\bullet\\chi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\phi\\bullet\\psi)\\bullet\\chi\\simeq_R\\phi\\bullet(\\psi\\bullet\\chi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf F(f;\\boldsymbol\\phi)\\bullet\\mathsf F(f;\\boldsymbol\\psi)\\simeq_R\\mathsf F(f;\\phi_1\\bullet\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_n\\bullet\\psi_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf F(f;\\boldsymbol\\phi)\\bullet\\mathsf F(f;\\boldsymbol\\psi)\\simeq_R\\mathsf F(f;\\phi_1\\bullet\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_n\\bullet\\psi_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\boldsymbol\\phi)\\approx_R l\\langle\\boldsymbol\\phi\\rangle_\\lambda\\bullet\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\operatorname{Id}_R(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{Id}_R(t_{k_\\lambda})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\boldsymbol\\phi)\\approx_R l\\langle\\boldsymbol\\phi\\rangle_\\lambda\\bullet\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\operatorname{Id}_R(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{Id}_R(t_{k_\\lambda})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\boldsymbol\\phi)\\approx_R\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\operatorname{Id}_R(s_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{Id}_R(s_{k_\\lambda}))\\bullet r\\langle\\boldsymbol\\phi\\rangle_\\lambda.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\boldsymbol\\phi)\\approx_R\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\operatorname{Id}_R(s_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{Id}_R(s_{k_\\lambda}))\\bullet r\\langle\\boldsymbol\\phi\\rangle_\\lambda.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\phi\\preccurlyeq_R\\psi\\iff\\exists\\chi\\in\\{\\zeta\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R:T_R\\phi=S_R\\zeta\\}\\;(\\phi\\bullet\\chi\\approx_R\\psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\phi\\preccurlyeq_R\\psi\\iff\\exists\\chi\\in\\{\\zeta\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R:T_R\\phi=S_R\\zeta\\}\\;(\\phi\\bullet\\chi\\approx_R\\psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\phi\\simeq_R\\psi\\Longrightarrow\\phi\\approx_R\\psi\\Longrightarrow(S_R\\phi=S_R\\psi\\land T_R\\phi=T_R\\psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\phi\\simeq_R\\psi\\Longrightarrow\\phi\\approx_R\\psi\\Longrightarrow(S_R\\phi=S_R\\psi\\land T_R\\phi=T_R\\psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>方程按同端点类型生成，不跨不匹配的组合。每个生成方程两端的源目标相同；结构方程由递归直接检查，I/O由模式实例化端点公式检查。对同余生成过程归纳，便得端点不变。Id单位使前缀关系自反，组合结合与同余使其传递。I把变量内部归约提前，O把它推后；被右项复制或删除的子证明随右项实例化复制或删除。不能把置换等价简化为普通步序列的等长排列。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的Terese (2003)本地DjVu；书页为印刷页，OCR块按U+001F从1编号。源文件及规范化文字哈希已与前轮重核。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-proofterm-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"b93c21fedffb4c4c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-proofterm-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-proofterm-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"b93c21fedffb4c4c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[56-df-proofterm-substitution]]。下列各方程仅在所有组合均类型化时取实例。$\\square$ 是异于证明树构造标签的新孔符号。原始一孔证明树上下文 $K$ 的孔填入记作 $K[\\zeta]$，其中 $\\zeta\\in\\mathcal Q_R$；填孔、闭包算子与生成关系均在下文定义。$B\\subseteq\\operatorname{PT}_R^2$，$\\phi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R$。规则构造及I/O方程分支局部取 $\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R$；各方程中的 $\\phi_i:s_i\\to t_i$ 表示 $S_R(\\phi_i)=s_i,T_R(\\phi_i)=t_i$，不是额外归约关系。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\square","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"K[\\zeta]","display":false},{"tex":"\\zeta\\in\\mathcal Q_R","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq\\operatorname{PT}_R^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi_i:s_i\\to t_i","display":false},{"tex":"S_R(\\phi_i)=s_i,T_R(\\phi_i)=t_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K_R\\coloneqq\\mu A\\;\\left(\\{\\square\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{f\\in\\mathcal F}\\;\\bigcup_{j=1}^{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}\\{\\mathsf F(f;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{j-1},K,\\phi_{j+1},\\ldots,\\phi_n):n=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ K\\in A,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^n\\}\\right.","display":true},{"tex":"\\left.\\hspace{1em}\\cup\\bigcup_{\\lambda\\in R}\\;\\bigcup_{j=1}^{k_\\lambda}\\{\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{j-1},K,\\phi_{j+1},\\ldots,\\phi_{k_\\lambda}):K\\in A,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^{k_\\lambda}\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf C(K,\\phi),\\mathsf C(\\phi,K):K\\in A,\\ \\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R\\}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"(-)[-]:\\mathcal K_R\\times\\mathcal Q_R\\to\\mathcal Q_R,\\qquad \\square[\\zeta]\\coloneqq\\zeta\\quad(\\zeta\\in\\mathcal Q_R).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf F(f;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{j-1},K,\\phi_{j+1},\\ldots,\\phi_n)[\\zeta]\n\\coloneqq\\mathsf F(f;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{j-1},K[\\zeta],\\phi_{j+1},\\ldots,\\phi_n)\n\\quad(f\\in\\mathcal F,\\ n=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ 1\\le j\\le n,\\ K\\in\\mathcal K_R,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^n,\\ \\zeta\\in\\mathcal Q_R).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{j-1},K,\\phi_{j+1},\\ldots,\\phi_{k_\\lambda})[\\zeta]\n\\coloneqq\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{j-1},K[\\zeta],\\phi_{j+1},\\ldots,\\phi_{k_\\lambda})\n\\quad(\\lambda\\in R,\\ 1\\le j\\le k_\\lambda,\\ K\\in\\mathcal K_R,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^{k_\\lambda},\\ \\zeta\\in\\mathcal Q_R).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf C(K,\\phi)[\\zeta]\\coloneqq\\mathsf C(K[\\zeta],\\phi),\\qquad\n\\mathsf C(\\phi,K)[\\zeta]\\coloneqq\\mathsf C(\\phi,K[\\zeta])\n\\quad(K\\in\\mathcal K_R,\\ \\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R,\\ \\zeta\\in\\mathcal Q_R).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cg}_R(B)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\left\\{E\\subseteq\\operatorname{PT}_R^2:\\Delta_{\\operatorname{PT}_R}\\cup B\\subseteq E,\\ E^{-1}=E,\\ E\\circ E\\subseteq E,\\ \\forall K\\in\\mathcal K_R\\;\\forall(\\phi,\\psi)\\in E\\;\\bigl(\\{K[\\phi],K[\\psi]\\}\\subseteq\\operatorname{PT}_R\\Rightarrow(K[\\phi],K[\\psi])\\in E\\bigr)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"B_{\\rm str}\\coloneqq\\{(\\operatorname{Id}_R(S_R\\phi)\\bullet\\phi,\\phi),(\\phi\\bullet\\operatorname{Id}_R(T_R\\phi),\\phi):\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\hspace{1em}\\cup\\{((\\phi\\bullet\\psi)\\bullet\\chi,\\phi\\bullet(\\psi\\bullet\\chi)):\\phi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R,\\ T_R\\phi=S_R\\psi,\\ T_R\\psi=S_R\\chi\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\hspace{1em}\\cup\\{(\\mathsf F(f;\\boldsymbol\\phi)\\bullet\\mathsf F(f;\\boldsymbol\\psi),\\mathsf F(f;\\phi_1\\bullet\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_n\\bullet\\psi_n)):f\\in\\mathcal F,\\ n=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi,\\boldsymbol\\psi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^n,\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(T_R\\phi_i=S_R\\psi_i)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"B_I\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\boldsymbol\\phi),l\\langle\\boldsymbol\\phi\\rangle_\\lambda\\bullet\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\operatorname{Id}_R(T_R\\phi_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{Id}_R(T_R\\phi_{k_\\lambda}))) :\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^{k_\\lambda}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"B_O\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\boldsymbol\\phi),\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\operatorname{Id}_R(S_R\\phi_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{Id}_R(S_R\\phi_{k_\\lambda}))\\bullet r\\langle\\boldsymbol\\phi\\rangle_\\lambda):\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^{k_\\lambda}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\simeq_R\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cg}_R(B_{\\rm str}),\\qquad\\approx_R\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cg}_R(B_{\\rm str}\\cup B_I\\cup B_O).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Id}_R(S_R\\phi)\\bullet\\phi\\simeq_R\\phi,\\qquad\\phi\\bullet\\operatorname{Id}_R(T_R\\phi)\\simeq_R\\phi.","display":true},{"tex":"(\\phi\\bullet\\psi)\\bullet\\chi\\simeq_R\\phi\\bullet(\\psi\\bullet\\chi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf F(f;\\boldsymbol\\phi)\\bullet\\mathsf F(f;\\boldsymbol\\psi)\\simeq_R\\mathsf F(f;\\phi_1\\bullet\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_n\\bullet\\psi_n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\boldsymbol\\phi)\\approx_R l\\langle\\boldsymbol\\phi\\rangle_\\lambda\\bullet\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\operatorname{Id}_R(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{Id}_R(t_{k_\\lambda})).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\boldsymbol\\phi)\\approx_R\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\operatorname{Id}_R(s_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{Id}_R(s_{k_\\lambda}))\\bullet r\\langle\\boldsymbol\\phi\\rangle_\\lambda.","display":true},{"tex":"\\phi\\preccurlyeq_R\\psi\\iff\\exists\\chi\\in\\{\\zeta\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R:T_R\\phi=S_R\\zeta\\}\\;(\\phi\\bullet\\chi\\approx_R\\psi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\phi\\simeq_R\\psi\\Longrightarrow\\phi\\approx_R\\psi\\Longrightarrow(S_R\\phi=S_R\\psi\\land T_R\\phi=T_R\\psi).","display":true}],"bytes":5998,"backlinks":[{"id":"05ef806ab27a7169","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[56-df-levy-proofterm-lifting]] 与 [[56-lem-levy-lifting]]。$\\phi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R$ 共源，$\\hat s\\in T_R^L$ 满足 $\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s)=S_R(\\phi)=S_R(\\psi)$。置换等价与具体路径证明项见 [[56-df-proofterm-permutation]]、[[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]。$\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R$ 共源，且 $\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s)=\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)$。"},{"id":"dbeb02768e341bce","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定正交系统。$\\Pi,\\Xi\\in\\mathcal P_R$，$T(\\Pi)=S(\\Xi)$；$P\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(T(\\Xi))$ 且 $\\operatorname{Prefix}_{T(\\Xi)}(P)$，前缀与祖先保持见 [[56-df-position-slices]]、[[56-lem-slice-ancestor]]。$A_R,\\operatorname{NAll}_R,\\operatorname{NNone}_R,\\nu_{SR},\\operatorname{PWit}_R$ 见 [[56-df-needed-sr-measure]]。假设 $\\operatorname{NNone}_R(\\Pi,A_R(\\Xi,P))$ 与 $\\operatorname{NAll}_R(\\Xi,P)$。完整发展菱形见 [[56-thm-complete-development-diamond]]，置换及trace不变性见 [[56-df-proofterm-permutation]]、[[56-lem-trace-permutation]]。"},{"id":"8739f2bb78813039","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定正交系统，$\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R$，$\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)$。$\\operatorname{wit}_R,\\bullet,\\approx_R,\\preccurlyeq_R$ 见 [[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]、[[56-df-proofterm-permutation]]。指定残余的平行移动及完整发展菱形见 [[56-lem-residual-parallel-moves]]、[[56-thm-complete-development-diamond]]，发展有限性见 [[56-thm-finite-developments]]。"},{"id":"676ac8d00a5a40c5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定普通TRS，使用 [[56-df-proofterm-permutation]]、[[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]。$\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R$，$\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R$，且 $\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)$。"},{"id":"8070a21336326571","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PT}_R,\\operatorname{Id}_R,S_R,T_R,\\mathsf F,\\mathsf L,\\bullet,\\approx_R$ 和实例化 $q\\langle\\boldsymbol\\phi\\rangle_\\lambda$ 采用 [[56-df-proofterm-permutation]]。$\\operatorname{Tr}_R^m,\\mathcal F_f,\\mathcal L_\\lambda^m$ 采用 [[56-df-proofterm-traces]]。$\\phi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R$，$m\\in\\{\\mathrm d,\\mathrm s\\}$，$t\\in T$；$\\Delta_A=\\{(z,z)\\mid z\\in A\\}$。所有后列证明项组合都取类型化实例。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-115","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-proofterm-permutation.md]]"},{"id":"94c9aea947b97724","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-edge-expanded-reduction]] 的左线性系统。$\\operatorname{Orthogonal}$ 见 [[56-df-orthogonal]]，$\\mathrm{NF}$ 见 [[56-df-normal-form]]。$\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R$ 同源；$X\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho))$；$\\operatorname{wit}$ 见 [[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]，$\\approx$ 见 [[56-df-proofterm-permutation]] 的相应系统实例。$s\\in T,Y\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(s)$，$z\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(s)$。"},{"id":"efe12b141b93e7e9","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定正交系统。$\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$，$\\operatorname{Std}_R,\\operatorname{PStd}_R$ 见 [[56-df-standard-labelled-reduction]]；$\\operatorname{wit}_R,\\approx_R$ 分别取 [[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]、[[56-df-proofterm-permutation]] 的具体归约见证与置换等价。有限证明项的归约化见 [[56-lem-proofterm-serialization]]，SR测度及其良基性见 [[56-df-sr-measure]]、[[56-lem-sr-measure-well-founded]]；标准路径的单元素平行化保持标准性见 [[56-lem-standard-implies-parallel-standard]]。"}],"outgoing":["b93c21fedffb4c4c"]}